<title>USA: USA-STOCKS-OPEN.</title>
<headline>USA-STOCKS-OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Street stocks were higher in early trade on Friday as the Dow industrials bounced back from Thursday's selloff and high-tech stocks extended their rally.</p>
<p>The Dow Industrials were up 18 at 6838 points. The Nasdaq Composite was up four at 1264.</p>
